    "+60 (Binary) = 00111100 1's complement = 11000011 +1 (Add 1) = 00000001 ----------------------------- -60 (2’s comp) = 11000100",
    "Step 3: Binary Addition",
    "11011101 (-35) + 11000100 (-60) ----------- 110000001 (9 bits, discard carry) ----------- 10100001 (8-bit sum)",
    "Result = 10100001 (MSB = 1 → Negative number)",
    "1's complement = 01011110 +1 = 00000001 ----------------------------- Magnitude = 01011111 → 95",
    "So, Final Answer = -95"
